OL,3,GNEWSACollege's #5.9m revamp includes
OL,4,Aconstruction studio
OL,5,
OL,6,FA college will undergo a #5.9m revamp
OL,7,Fdue to rising student numbers and
OL,8,Fincreased interest in construction and
OL,9,Fcreative courses.
OL,11,FNew studios, media suites and an open
OL,12,Fplan art studio are among the
OL,13,Fimprovements planned for Wiltshire
OL,14,FCollege and University's Trowbridge
OL,15,FCampus. Construction workshops will
OL,16,Falso double in size to allow space for
OL,17,Fmore students.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
