OL,3,GNEWSACollege's #5.9m revamp includes
OL,4,Aconstruction studio
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Ultimately, this expansion has been
OL,7,Fdriven by increasing demand for
OL,8,Fconstruction and creative courses, as
OL,9,Fwell as recognising the changing needs
OL,10,Fof employers," said Steve Campion, the
OL,11,Fcollege's deputy principal of corporate
OL,12,Fresources.
OL,14,FThe revamp is being paid for via #4.8m
OL,15,Ffrom the Department of Education (DfE)
OL,16,Fand from college reserves.
